      "title": "告别时分·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "40619001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……动用了「天启」的情报渠道，所有活化的弗吉尼娅个体都已经找到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "你的提议很好……将她们持有的力量残片夺过来……我一定能回到曾经的姿态……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "但在我休眠的时候……你似乎还做了不少多余的事……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "自活化以来，我从未放下过憎恨。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "「不朽灾祸」……你应该任何人都清楚，我对黑暗的渴望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "魔女的手颤抖着，高高举起的剑依旧没能挥下。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619007",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……你背叛了我……这个仪式……禁锢了所有的出路……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "呵，不用想着找新的宿主，你离不开这个建筑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "唔——咳，在内部啃噬我，也改变不了什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "弗吉尼娅……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "现在的我……无法自杀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "背景音的呓语满溢着焦躁和恐慌，它显然知晓自己的命运。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "谢谢你，诺伊尔……坚持我曾经的誓言。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "啊，再见了，前圣域卫士，弗吉尼娅。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "魔女不再犹豫，剑刃如风般斩下——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不……还有可以夺取的宿主……将你献给我！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这一瞬间，浓稠的黑影从失序者的身上抽离，如流体一般汇集至半空中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "它的眼中只有一个目标——诺伊尔。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "（古精灵语）我许愿……光明将消灭所有的黑暗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "炽烈的光芒在室内爆发，仿佛所有的日光在此间聚集。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不……不要……我会……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……只有黑暗才是永恒……只有杀戮才是……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "光明与黑暗，所有的一切都消散了，就像从未发生过。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "这下……真的结束了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "刚才，剑刃确实触及了失序者的身体，但魔女的护盾阻止了它的前进。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我不会就这样放过你……你要活着为所有人赎罪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619029",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619030",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "随着「不朽灾祸」的影响消失，狂化的手办们纷纷失去了意识。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619031",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "焦急的众人赶到仪式现场，只见事件的黑幕——弗吉尼娅坐倒在地。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619032",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在她的不远处，是魔女和她的使魔。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "……好了，好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40619035",
              "text": "我只是有点想睡觉。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40619035",
              "text": "不过是区区致命伤。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40619034",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "对不起，我……都是我的错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "相信我，我一定会治好你的……我一定会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619037",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "生命力在流失……先前被治疗术阻碍的进程，仍在朝终点推进。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619038",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "名为死的寒意渐渐要将你冻结——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我……又一次没能守住珍视的事物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "没关系的……诺伊尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我答应过，要和你一起前往深渊的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "啊，啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我甚至还不知道你的……名字……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619044",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "当行在死荫的幽谷，原先由浓雾笼罩的记忆，却终于豁然开朗。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619045",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "我想起来了，我的名字是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "乌鸦",
          "text": "|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619047",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "啊……|101|……我记住了……我记住你了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619048",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我是不会允许你溜走的……我们要永远在一起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40619049",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "【|101|】离开了【魔女诺伊尔】的队伍。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1010",
