      "title": "告别时分·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "40620001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "手办收容设施「绿洲」，中央区域。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "外面……大概是晚上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯，你所引发的事件，已经完美地落幕了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "从隔壁的收容室传来的女性嗓音，带着一股淡淡的海的气息。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你是这样认为的吗，贝歌？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "「不朽灾祸」已经消灭，你终于能够变回曾经的模样了，那位像太阳一样温暖的骑士。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "即使是时间，也无法抚平那些痕迹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我也还没有无耻到，将所有的罪孽推给那东西的地步。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "那位守夜人小姐，知道不夜城的人造太阳的本质吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "她确实有所察觉，但很快，我就把一切都毁掉了，无论好坏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "沉默持续了一段时间，直到半鱼人的声音再次响起。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……我认识的弗吉尼娅，可不会就这样逃跑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "即使饱受折磨，她也会想要看看绝望的尽头会是什么，即使那是更惨烈的结果。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "听到这里，失序者缓缓地将短剑从颈边放下。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "是啊，我还没有去死的资格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "我们都不过是命运的囚徒，从曾经的世界延伸而来的影子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "而我想祝福她……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "在这个世界，过上新的生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "平常的一天，爱猫社区。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "人类，你昨天是不是又熬夜了？上次都昏倒了，还不注意多休息吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40620022",
              "text": "好的，我会的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40620022",
              "text": "我一般不熬夜，只通宵。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40620021",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "哎，真是得住在你这，天天盯着你才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620023",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "门铃响了起来。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我去开门。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "房门开启，一个手办正静静地站在门口，她有着漆黑的裙甲和宵色的剑。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "唷，你就是|101|？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "看上去有点熟悉的魔女冷冷地望着你。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是的，有什么事吗?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "准备好——和我一同前往深渊了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620030",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "其实，你早就已经有了答案。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "40620032",
              "text": "当然了，诺伊尔。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "40620032",
              "text": "我已经答应过你了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "40620031",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620032",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "——暴风雨已然过去，魔女宽恕了仇人，走出了荒岛。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "40620033",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "——而她和你的冒险，将永无止期。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
